# Server database (POLLENINFO_DB, default ./data/polleninfo.db relative to the working directory —
# `server/` under `./gradlew :server:run`). Anchored on purpose: a bare `data/` would also ignore
# every `data/` source package in the app.
/data/
/server/data/
